<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eelicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">brueder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seeliger</unclear>. Inen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermög</unclear> irer
